horised to run at normal speed towards another service stranded on the trac=
k. The death toll has now risen to 69. Among the number was F=C3=A1tima B=
=C3=A1=C3=B1ez, who was an employment minister in Mariano Rajoy=E2=80=99s c=
onservative government. Yesterday, Spain <a href=3D"https://link.thetimes.c=
